'''''Atrichum undulatum''''' is a species of [[mosses]] belonging to the family [[Polytrichaceae]].<ref name="worldfloraonline.org">{{cite web |title=Atrichum undulatum (Hedw.) P. Beauv. |url=http://www.worldfloraonline.org/taxon/wfo-0001192448 |website=www.worldfloraonline.org |access-date=28 January 2021}}</ref>

It is native to [[Eurasia]] and North America.<ref name="GBIF">{{cite web |title=Atrichum undulatum Palisot de Beauvois, 1805 |url=https://www.gbif.org/species/2673299 |website=www.gbif.org |access-date=28 January 2021 |language=en}}</ref>

